{"id":"0bf65c39-48cf-4d8c-9169-848fe5860214","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a4eb2d27eddc588a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/app/tools/page-tools.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5f75277a41635b8a5c91abe7221daa1db996dde1","start":0,"end":46},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","Hub","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/hub","\""]},"context":{"after":"a336c3bc0b143903"}},"payload":{"text":"The editor's tools (host.ts) as observability page tools, which the tab serves and debug-mcp registers while it's\nconnected: a tool's zod input shape announced as JSON Schema (debug-mcp makes zod of it again), and its handler run\nwith the call's signal. Its answer is its ToolResult (`ok` / `fail`), which debug-mcp passes on as it is.\n\nKept apart from index.ts (whose glob only Vite can read), so a test can serve a family's tools.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:03:45.128Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:03:45.128Z"}
